        "imageRatio": "30",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
        "alt": "IBASE IB836 BOARD",
        "text": "<p>IBASE Atom x6000E-based modules offer industrial desktop performance, blazing fast graphics and IO - compact, mighty and efficient</p>\r\n<p>The IBASE IB836 Intel Atom x6000E-based SBC’s include a rich portfolio of Intel® Atom™ based modules. The Atom™ x6000E family SBC’s take real-time compute performance and control flexibility to the next level while maintaining a small footprint and lower power.</p>\r\n",
        "displayPopupTitle": "true",
        "linkTarget": "_self",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 24 2026 12:55:48 GMT+0000",
        "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
        "isDecorative": "false",
