       "textwithimage_copy": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/products/boards-modules/ibase/images/IBASE IB836 6000.png",
        "imageRatio": "30",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
        "alt": "IBASE IB836 BOARD",
        "text": "<p>IBASE IB836 x6000E Single Board Computer - 3.5”</p>\r\n<p>They count with:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Compute performance: +50% to 70%</li>\r\n<li>GPU performance: +100% with 3x 4K/60p interfaces, Integrated Gen 11 graphics</li>\r\n<li>High-end memory: DDR4-3200, up to 32GB (with IBECC)</li>\r\n<li>Comprehensive IO: M.2 E-key/2230, 3x USB 3.1, USB C, 2x USB 2.0, GPIO, HD Audio</li>\r\n<li>Triple network: 3x GbE</li>\r\n<li>Wide power input range: 9 to 36 VDC</li>\r\n<li>Low power: 6 to 12W typical depending on CPU selected</li>\r\n<li>TPM 2.0 and Watchdog timer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Need special configurations or customized hardware or BIOS? Just ask!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>These are just part of what separates the IBASE IB836 Intel Atom x6000E-based SBC and Macnica from the competition.</p>\r\n",
        "displayPopupTitle": "true",
        "linkTarget": "_self",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Oct 01 2026 15:31:22 GMT+0000",
        "titleValueFromDAM": "true",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/textwithimage",
