       "title_table": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:title": "Specifications",
        "type": "h1",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
       },
       "table": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "valter.toffolo@macnicadhw.com.br",
        "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody><tr><th>CPU</th>\r\n<td><p>Intel® Atom™ QC x6425E (1.8GHz/3.0GHz, 1.5MB cache, 12W TDP)</p>\r\n<p>Intel® Atom™ QC x6413E (1.5GHz/3.0GHz, 1.5MB cache, 9W TDP)</p>\r\n<p>Intel® Atom™ DC x6211E (1.2GHz/3.0GHz, 1.5MB cache, 6W TDP)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>PCH</th>\r\n<td>Integrated in Intel® SoC</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Memory Types</th>\r\n<td>DDR4-3200 SO-DIMM, Max. 32GB, supports IBECC</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>BIOS</th>\r\n<td>AMI</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Watchdog Timer</th>\r\n<td>256 levels</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>H/W Monitor</th>\r\n<td>Yes</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Storage Device Interface</th>\r\n<td>1x mSATA (Share with SATA port)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Mini Type Slots</th>\r\n<td>1x M.2 (E-Key, type:2230)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Graphics Controller</th>\r\n<td>Intel® SoC integrated Gen11 Graphics</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Video Output</th>\r\n<td>2x DisplayPort (DP connector and Type-C), eDP or 24-bit dual-channel LVDS</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Ethernet</th>\r\n<td>3x Intel® I210IT PCI-E Gigabit LAN</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>I/O Chip</th>\r\n<td>Fintek F81964D-I</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Serial Port</th>\r\n<td>1x RS232/422/485 (Jumperless selection)<br>\r\n3x RS232</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>USB 2.0</th>\r\n<td>2x USB 2.0 (Pin-header)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>USB 3.0/ 3.1</th>\r\n<td>3x USB3.1 (Type-A)<br>\r\n1x USB Type-C</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Serial ATA</th>\r\n<td>2x SATA III</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Audio</th>\r\n<td>Built-in HD with Realtek ALC269 w/ class-D amplifier</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>TPM</th>\r\n<td>TPM (2.0)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Others</th>\r\n<td>Digital I/O (4-in/4-out), EuP/ErP, +9V~+36V DC-in</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Dimensions (L x W)</th>\r\n<td>102 mm x 147 mm (4&quot; x 5.8&quot;)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Power Consumption</th>\r\n<td>TBD</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Operating Temperature</th>\r\n<td>-40°C~85°C (-40°F ~185°F)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Storage Temperature</th>\r\n<td>-40°C~90°C (-40°F ~194°F)</td>\r\n</tr><tr><th>Relative Humidity</th>\r\n<td>90% (non-condensing @ 60°C)</td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table>",
        "jcr:lastModified": "Sun Sep 06 2026 15:05:23 GMT+0000",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/table",
